      "title": "Yemen\u2019s Prime Minister Condemns Terrorist Attack on Church in Jordan",
      "description": "ADEN-SABA Prime Minister Dr. Shaya Zindani has extended his sincere condolences to Jordan\u2019s King, government and people over the victims of the terrorist attack on a church in Karak Governorate, wishing the injured a speedy recovery. In a post on X, Dr. Zindani said that targeting places of worship is a horrific crime that undermines the values of coexistence and tolerance and highlights the danger of terrorism as a cross-border threat requiring a unified and firm Arab and international response to protect the security and stability of societies. He stressed that the Yemeni government, which faces the same terrorist approach targeting civilians and innocent people, stands in full solidarity with Jordan and supports its efforts to combat terrorism and extremism, as well as all joint efforts to curb the capabilities of terrorist groups and cut off their sources of support.",
